# Magvault camera profile
name: Sony NEX-VG20
id: sony-vg20

vendor: Sony
model: NEX-VG20
card_layout: MP_ROOT
filename_pattern: *.MPG, *.MTS

file_formats: AVCHD, MPEG-2 PS
default_format: AVCHD

gamma: Rec.709, CinemaTone
default_gamma: Rec.709

gamut: Rec.709
default_gamut: Rec.709

typical_resolutions: 1920x1080, 1440x1080, 720x576
typical_fps: 24, 25, 30, 50, 60
audio_channels: 2, 6

notes: Tightened. Requires top-level MP_ROOT so it does not claim AX53, FS5, A7 III or CX350. Live model string is NEX-VG20E in MPEG MVI_DATA. Do not trust AVF_INFO leftovers.
